cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the paper below."
title: "Bonds or Gold: The Price of Monetary Trust"
abstract: >
  A test of the practitioner four-quadrant allocation framework, decomposed into
  its energy and monetary axes on thirteen markets. The monetary axis, a bond
  total-return index over gold, survives; the energy axis does not; the surviving
  rule is a single binary switch between bonds and gold.
type: software
